+              "a busy gate at the quick build: the entry tried again later, a must draw goes on to wait for the full build");
+        check(quick_pipe::take(g, false, 8, gb, 1, ask_none, build_ok, destroy, now, poll) == quick_pipe::Got::kQuick &&
